Description: OMV Intelligent Agent Helper
 An animated, context-aware assistant for OpenMediaVault 8.
 .
 Provides intelligent suggestions for NAS management, Linux filesystem
 operations, and OMV configuration. Features a safety-first design
 where all system change suggestions require explicit user confirmation
 before being shown. The agent cannot execute any commands — it only
 provides guidance.
 .
 Features:
  - Persistent animated helper widget on every OMV page
  - Context-aware suggestions based on current OMV section
  - Built-in Linux filesystem knowledge (ext4, btrfs, XFS, ZFS, NFS, SMB)
  - Session-scoped deduplication (no repeated answers)
  - Off-topic rejection (only answers OMV/NAS/Linux questions)
  - System change warnings with confirmation gate
  - Live system probes: drive temps, RAID status, load, disk usage
  - Optional loopback-only local Ollama fallback for human phrasing
  - Fully offline — no external API calls
 .
 Supports ARM64 and AMD64 (Architecture: all).
